SY_TALK("j1Z6c4EUqRg",[[0,["The other day I was telling you"]],[3,["about our growth within, after Self-realisation."]],[9,["The germination takes place very easily;"]],[16,["the Kundalini rises very easily;"]],[21,["also pierces the fontanelle bone area very easily."]],[32,["That is really, as you call it, ‘Sahaja’."]],[38,["It’s a tremendous happening."]],[40,["It takes thousands of years for people to get realisation."]],[45,["That’s also a fact."]],[49,["They had to be born again and again"]],[52,["and very few selected got realisation."]],[59,["But today, as I said, the time has come"]],[66,["for many flowers to become fruits."]],[72,["So this happening doesn’t take much time,"]],[77,["it’s just [a] split of a second in many people."]],[82,["But about the growth I was talking last time,"]],[86,["I ended up at Self-realisation, what is Self-realisation is"]],[92,["and what do we expect from Self-realisation."]],[98,["The first thing that happens to you, as you know,"]],[101,["when the Kundalini rises, [is]"]],[107,["that you start feeling physically better; your health improves."]],[113,["Though the Kundalini rises from the centre most nadi,"]],[119,["called as Brahmanadi, inside the Sushumna, in the central part."]],[124,["And first thing that happens is the physical being which is helped."]],[136,["That is not the innermost core of every centre."]],[141,["The innermost core of every centre is the Spiritual."]],[150,["But how is it [that] first the physical being is helped?"]],[154,["Is very interesting to see."]],[158,["The Kundalini rises through many centres, passes through Agya,"]],[167,["pierces through fontanelle,"]],[169,["and becomes one with the All-pervading Power."]],[176,["So, first thing that receives the information is the seat of Sadashiva,"]],[182,["is the seat of your Atma, your Spirit, on top of your head."]],[188,["But the Spirit is in your heart."]],[191,["So the first awakening takes place, or enlightenment takes place,"]],[195,["in your brain. It’s a very important point to be seen."]],[202,["In your brain resides the conscious mind,"]],[208,["that means the present,"]],[212,["and when it is enlightened that means your awareness is enlightened;"]],[220,["you get enlightenment in your awareness,"]],[226,["in your attention."]],[228,["As I told you last time that attention is enlightened first."]],[233,["So through your attention you can find out"]],[235,["what is the matter with other persons, you can find out"]],[238,["what centres are catching,"]],[240,["what your centres are catching. So, on the physical level,"]],[249,["you know what’s happening."]],[254,["That’s the, we should say, the present."]],[259,["We feel our gross (physical) being enlightened,"]],[263,["we can feel them on our fingers."]],[270,["But when the Kundalini is rising in your being,"]],[278,["She goes straight on to the fontanelle bone area."]],[285,["Of course, if there is a hurdle or anything then She stops"]],[289,["and tries to indicate."]],[294,["At that time, if She is not successful,"]],[298,["for example you have got a liver problem,"]],[301,["then She will come and throb at liver problem,"]],[303,["informing you that there’s something wrong with the liver."]],[307,["That’s why a Sahaja Yogi has to give vibrations from outside."]],[314,["When the Kundalini rises above the Agya,"]],[324,["She goes up to this fontanelle and pierces."]],[328,["But when She cannot go beyond Agya She spreads out here."]],[335,["She can spread out here also."]],[339,["And then She starts trickling down,"]],[344,["the grace on the…"]],[348,["or you can say She starts relaxing"]],[354,["this area which is called as murdha (brain)"]],[358,["and that’s how She makes more space in the Agya."]],[365,["And this relaxation works out the outer side of the physical being."]],[371,["Also when She pierces through"]],[374,["in anyone who has a simpler personality,"]],[383,["who is not so complicated, first thing that happens"]],[388,["is that the grace starts falling through from the sides;"]],[392,["and the Grace starts falling into the Ida and Pingala"]],[400,["and then She comes down by which She supplies Ida and Pingala."]],[407,["The Grace, not the Kundalini,"]],[410,["you should not confuse these two things."]],[415,["Because of Her piercing, there’s an opening made"]],[417,["and the Grace starts coming down, and She,"]],[423,["I should say the Grace Itself, feeds all the centres from outside."]],[432,["So, first the physical being is improves."]],[441,["The second one, I’m now going from outside inside,"]],[452,["the second one is the mental being."]],[462,["Now the mental being relates to our awareness as well,"]],[468,["also to our sense of understanding, intellect and all those things."]],[475,["When the Grace starts flowing more and more within us,"]],[479,["then our mental being gets enlightened."]],[485,["When the mental being gets enlightened"]],[487,["then you start feeling centres of other persons."]],[494,["Some people you know just get cured."]],[499,["They don’t feel any vibrations, nothing, just they feel cured."]],[503,["They get cured of cancer, this, that, all sorts of things."]],[507,["But they do not get vibrations, they do not get a feeling,"]],[510,["they cannot make out whether it is this chakra or that chakra,"]],[514,["they do not feel anything."]],[519,["So the first thing that would happen to anyone is the physical gift,"]],[524,["the physical being improves – that’s the Grace of God."]],[529,["Because if you are not well,"]],[532,["if you have some pains and some troubles and some diseases,"]],[536,["how are you going to pay attention to God and Spirit?"]],[541,["That’s very important."]],[546,["But before it comes to the mental self,"]],[553,["something else happens also,"]],[558,["that, when the Kundalini pierces,"]],[563,["the falling of Grace first comes down"]],[571,["to the lower centres starting from Nabhi downwards."]],[578,["And Nabhi is a great sucker, Nabhi starts sucking the vibrations,"]],[584,["or you can say the Grace."]],[588,["And Nabhi starts getting awakened first of all."]],[594,["From Nabhi rises the Swadhishthana Chakra which goes round and round,"]],[599,["which is connected with Nabhi, so it flows to Swadhishthana"]],[606,["and then Swadhishthana also starts working out itself."]],[616,["Swadhishthana sucks in as much as possible"]],[619,["and works out all the centres,"]],[623,["I mean all the organs, which are supplied by it."]],[630,["But Nabhi, when it receives surplus Grace,"]],[640,["then it starts opening,"]],[646,["and its opening helps us in very gross material life also."]],[658,["You are helped materially."]],[661,["Supposing if you are materially absolutely hopeless,"]],[665,["then you are not going to pay attention to God also."]],[669,["So it’s the responsibility of God"]],[672,["to first give you a little material well-being."]],[675,["Like I received a letter and also on the tape"]],[678,["they have mentioned about somebody who wanted to come to India, from Australia."]],[684,["She got her realisation, she felt very much better,"]],[688,["and she wanted to come to India but she had no money to come,"]],[694,["and that desire was there. Because of that desire in her"]],[700,["she may not have put full attention to her Spirit."]],[708,["And that’s how our material desires get satisfied."]],[713,["And her daughter discovered, she had a bracelet,"]],[718,["many bracelets and things she had, and she went to a jumble sale,"]],[721,["for selling them for some sort of a programme they had for children."]],[728,["And they discovered that one of the bracelets that she had,"]],[732,["which she thought to be a junk, was of gold, surprisingly."]],[737,["And she sold it for $1500."]],[741,["She was going to sell it for 20c, you see,."]],[746,["And that was exactly the amount needed for their travel, for both of them."]],[753,["Now one would say that – how it works out?"]],[759,["It is miraculous, that’s all I can say, because the machinery is such."]],[765,["The pouring of the Grace within you, informs the Lakshmi Principle in the Nabhi."]],[777,["Nabhi just show them where is this."]],[779,["Somebody has to get up and show them,"]],[781,["Douglas? Or someone. Douglas (Fry) come along."]],[788,["This is the one. And this has the deity of Lakshmi,"]],[793,["She is the deity of your well-being."]],[797,["And this is what Krishna has said, “Yoga Kshema vahamyam”"]],[801,["“When the yoga takes place,"]],[802,["means when the Kundalini pierces through fontanelle bone area,"]],[806,["I look after your well-being.” How does he look after? Through Lakshmi."]],[812,["Now this is a universal Deity. She’s present in human beings"]],[819,["and also she is present in material things."]],[828,["It is such a fantastic thing"]],[833,["that you cannot explain these things"]],[836,["on human level, really it is difficult."]],[839,["Only thing you can see for yourself how it works out."]],[843,["It’s so tremendous. Like if you have to explain"]],[847,["about human civilisation to an ant it’s going to be difficult –"]],[851,["in the same way it is. It’s so difficult you see."]],[854,["And human beings they are so proud of their rationality"]],[857,["and I find it impossible how to explain, but it does work that way."]],[861,["You can only see the working of it."]],[864,["But if you are proud of your rationality you go ahead with it,"]],[868,["what can you do? But you just see for yourself how it works."]],[874,["So the second layer that really is improved is your material being."]],[880,["So many people have been helped, who are here, materially."]],[888,["The well-being has come, actual well-being, apart from satisfaction."]],[894,["But as I said, it does not cross the limit,"]],[897,["like you do not become Mr. Ford!"]],[902,["Because that’s some sort of a behaviour which is asahaja,"]],[906,["to be so rich, I mean it’s ridiculous, vulgar!"]],[912,["You become better than what you are, but not the best,"]],[920,["because you have to be in the centre at a satisfied point."]],[927,["And everybody has to enjoy you"]],[933,["and you have to enjoy everybody."]],[935,["But supposing if you are in dire necessities and problematic things"]],[940,["then you cannot pay attention to God and that’s what He understands –"]],[944,["that you cannot."]],[946,["If you have physical problem, if you have cancer,"]],[949,["how can you say that, “You pay attention to your Spirit,”"]],[952,["when you have cancer? I mean, such a body!"]],[954,["After all if this whole house is going to collapse"]],[957,["you cannot meditate here."]],[960,["So, first the physical stability is established and second is the material one."]],[967,["And there are many factors which work out material stability, automatically."]],[974,["First of them is that, once you find your Spirit,"]],[980,["you just automatically give up your habits."]],[986,["Most of these habits come from your Nabhi,"]],[990,["because from Nabhi Chakra you get your seeking."]],[994,["And you think, when you have a habit [that] you are seeking your joy."]],[998,["I mean, many people have said, “Mother, but I enjoy my glass of whiskey,”"]],[1003,["they have said to me, many a times."]],[1005,["Or, “I enjoy a little ride here and there,”"]],[1009,["somebody has said that, “Mother, I enjoy some Kensington ladies,”"]],[1013,["you see, sort of thing."]],[1015,["But once you start enjoying your Spirit, it drops out."]],[1020,["All your attention becomes enlightened and your priorities change."]],[1028,["You don’t enjoy these things that you have been enjoying before,"]],[1031,["so you just don’t do it. I mean, I don’t have to tell you,"]],[1033,["“Don’t drink!” you just don’t do it."]],[1036,["I don’t have to tell you that you don’t smoke, you just don’t do."]],[1039,["But there are some very weak people, extremely weak, I mean,"]],[1042,["very, very weak people. They take time, I know."]],[1045,["They plod and they are very slow moving creatures, but not all."]],[1059,["I would say quite a small number and"]],[1065,["most of the people, they just give up things. You just give up."]],[1071,["So you start saving money, automatically,"]],[1076,["because the money goes to the races or to the pubs"]],[1081,["or to other habits which are useless, you know they are useless:"]],[1084,["smoking, drugs,"]],[1087,["any such foolish things that you are wasting money on."]],[1092,["And you start channelizing this money for something better,"]],[1099,["something that gives you more joy,"]],[1102,["more happiness and of an eternal nature, not a temporary one,"]],[1105,["that you take the drink [the] previous night"]],[1108,["and in the morning you are finished!"]],[1110,["You get a drink that never finishes, which you enjoy all the time."]],[1117,["You get drunk like that. Because in my own life I have seen,"]],[1124,["it’s such a so-called sophisticated elite life."]],[1130,["People drink much more, you see, than normal people drink."]],[1134,["And they ask me, “Why don’t you drink?” I say, “I am already drunk!"]],[1138,["The day I was born I was so drunk that, now,"]],[1140,["if I have to drink more I’ll fall off, so better not ask me!”"]],[1144,["They are quite frightened at my, this thing,"]],[1146,["I said, “I am really fully drunk already!”"]],[1150,["So they start looking at me!"]],[1152,["And they never find me anyway less in spirits as they are."]],[1159,["Actually I’m always little more than they are,"]],[1162,["so they never force me to do that."]],[1165,["But these things drop out automatically."]],[1169,["I don’t have to tell you that you have to drop out."]],[1172,["Because most of the things you have done"]],[1174,["because you have been seeking something."]],[1176,["You know, there are people, I asked them, “Why do you do this?”"]],[1180,["They said, “We are seeking love,” I said “How?"]],[1182,["How can you find love like this?” Or somebody will say that,"]],[1185,["“I am seeking God.” There are many people who are taking drugs,"]],[1188,["I mean, genuinely, just for seeking."]],[1191,["But when they have found it, what they were seeking,"]],[1194,["they don’t take drugs. But this is one of the side issues,"]],[1198,["I was just trying to make it little lighter."]],[1201,["But mainly what happens is that, actually the principle of Lakshmi,"]],[1207,["the principle of well-being within you is awakened."]],[1214,["And if you listen to one of my tapes where I have described"]],[1219,["what a Lakshmi is, and how She is symbolised:"]],[1223,["it’s a very beautiful picture of Lakshmi"]],[1227,["that the great seers have put before us:"]],[1232,["That, She is after all a Mother, She is a mother."]],[1238,["A person who is a rich man has to be a motherly person."]],[1247,["But here you find, in the whole world I have seen [that]"]],[1250,["those who have even little money their nose goes up like that"]],[1254,["and if you see them from down below they look like wolves"]],[1258,["not like mothers – most surprising."]],[1262,["And this Lakshmi who is a Mother, wears a white sari,"]],[1272,["very elegant, with a gold border."]],[1277,["That represents that he doesn’t put people into awe"]],[1284,["by his pomp and show and this and that."]],[1289,["She’s standing on a lotus."]],[1292,["Imagine any human being standing on a lotus!"]],[1298,["That means that She’s so light in Her behaviour towards others."]],[1309,["She’s so delicate, She touches people with such delicacy,"]],[1315,["that people don’t feel hurt,"]],[1318,["they are not in any way pressurized by the riches of people."]],[1327,["But you know it’s just the opposite,"]],[1329,["if your so-called ‘rich’ you see! Horrible!"]],[1332,["If somebody’s coming in here I would like to get out of that door."]],[1339,["They try to pressurise because they have money."]],[1341,["You see, if somebody starts talking big, you just find out,"]],[1346,["99% he must have won some horse race!"]],[1352,["This pressurising is a sign that he is not a lakshmipati,"]],[1357,["he has nothing to do with Lakshmi. So he’s so gracious."]],[1366,["I have seen such people. I have seen some people like that."]],[1372,["I have seen one in England you will be surprised to know."]],[1378,["I have just seen him once. He was a gentleman"]],[1382,["who was some lord and something"]],[1385,["and later on he came to India and he was a Viceroy (Lord Mountbatten)."]],[1392,["And there was a gentleman who was very well known to us,"]],[1396,["he once met him in a train which was delayed or something happened"]],[1401,["and they had to get down at another station"]],[1405,["and somehow or other they were put together."]],[1407,["And he was so simple and so good and so helpful"]],[1411,["that this gentleman was taken by him."]],[1417,["He said, “Now better you come to my house because"]],[1419,["it’s not going to be any train, you come to my house.”"]],[1422,["When he went to his house he was surprised"]],[1424,["the house was like a palace! And then he told he who he was,"]],[1429,["and he was amazed! And he even carried his bag with him."]],[1435,["Such a simple man. And then, when this person told me"]],[1439,["that such a person is there, then he re-visited India,"]],[1443,["then he brought him to see me."]],[1444,["But he’s no more now he’s dead this gentleman."]],[1447,["But he was a very big man in India and a very big person"]],[1451,["but such a simple man! Such a simple person."]],[1457,["So that’s the significance of well-being."]],[1461,["So when a Sahaja Yogi becomes well-being, gets well-being"]],[1467,["then he has all these qualities in him that,"]],[1472,["he doesn’t impress on others that he has a property"]],[1478,["or he has got money and he should pressurise others."]],[1481,["If he’s really a good Sahaja Yogi he would be the humblest of all"]],[1487,["and he would be very generous because in Her hand,"]],[1491,["one hand is like this."]],[1494,["The left hand is like this, means She’s generous, She’s giving."]],[1497,["All the time She’s giving. She’s not taking anything,"]],[1500,["She’s giving. And that’s how such a person is all the time giving."]],[1505,["I have seen people who, after Sahaja Yoga,"]],[1511,["receive a lot of blessings and are miserly or try to oppress others,"]],[1517,["lose their properties and lose their money"]],[1520,["and really suffer a little bit."]],[1522,["Because otherwise there’s no way of teaching them."]],[1527,["So the generosity flows from Her hand"]],[1531,["and another hand is like this,"]],[1534,["which means that She gives protection to people."]],[1543,["There have to be some people who are ashritas, are dependents,"]],[1548,["who just depend, from whom such a person doesn’t take any money,"]],[1552,["they just live. These systems are still in India."]],[1558,["Those people who are well off always have about two, three people"]],[1564,["being supported by them. Is a system still working in India,"]],[1568,["in many places. I mean, in my father’s house we always remember"]],[1572,["we had people like that."]],[1574,["They were educated and given higher education by my father free,"]],[1578,["just free. But never did they feel that they were anybody else,"]],[1582,["treated with same respect and with same dignity as we were treated."]],[1587,["But that was a part of life, one had to do it."]],[1591,["This is the ashraya,"]],[1593,["is that there should be some people depending on you."]],[1596,["England also I’ve seen people have cats, dogs, things like that, you see,"]],[1599,["little bit they do spend on cats and dogs."]],[1605,["But better to spend on human beings."]],[1607,["What am I going to do with cats and dogs?"]],[1609,["Can I give them realization? (laughter)"]],[1614,["It’s better to look after human beings"]],[1617,["than to look after cats and dogs so much!"]],[1620,["But I have seen that when they are dealing with cats and dogs"]],[1623,["they are very happy people,"]],[1624,["but with human beings they are very unhappy, I don’t know why."]],[1627,["If you must have seen in the BBC and all that,"]],[1630,["when they have these advertisements I have seen in television sometimes,"]],[1633,["you see a person having a cat, she’ll always smile and joke and this."]],[1638,["And anybody having children, she looks so miserable! (laughter)"]],[1646,["That should not be so. There should be somebody dependent."]],[1652,["It’s not important to measure every money, to ask for 2p (£0.02)"]],[1657,["– “I gave you yesterday, will you return 2p to me?”"]],[1661,["It doesn’t behove a Sahaja Yogi to be like that."]],[1665,["If it comes to that, alright, give some money – forget about it."]],[1670,["It helps you such a lot, it helps you such a lot."]],[1674,["To be meticulously so observant about how much money you lent"]],[1679,["it’s better to be more worried about how much you have taken"]],[1683,["than to be how much you have given. It helps a lot."]],[1688,["It’s a thing one has to realize in life, how much it helps."]],[1694,["I have seen in my own life it has helped so many times."]],[1700,["I mean you really have people then, around you."]],[1704,["It’s a matter of 5 Rupees and 10 Rupees."]],[1708,["It’s so important then to some people at a [certain] point,"]],[1712,["and it works wonders!"]],[1716,["I mean, you can have a human worth millions by paying sometimes 5 Rupees,"]],[1723,["it can work out that way. So try to be more giving"]],[1727,["and then you receive more as a Sahaja Yogi."]],[1729,["Remember that now you are connected with Lakshmi."]],[1735,["The more generous you are the more you get it."]],[1739,["When you are small-minded you do no receive Her blessings."]],[1744,["You have to give, you have to give."]],[1747,["Once you give, it starts flowing, the stagnation is over"]],[1752,["and the flow starts coming in."]],[1754,["Otherwise you are stagnated when your hand is, you see,"]],[1757,["tight fisted as you call it."]],[1760,["English language has so many good words,"]],[1764,["though they are now losing their meaning!"]],[1767,["They call it you are very, I don’t know there must be some new words"]],[1772,["for being very, very miserly, some good word, you know,"]],[1775,["which doesn’t mean miserly but must be some ‘economical’"]],[1779,["or something fantastic. But actually miserliness, is miserliness,"]],[1785,["give it whatever name you like, it’s horrible."]],[1788,["And one should not take to miserliness,"]],[1791,["that is a curse I tell you, it’s a disease,"]],[1795,["it’s like leprosy, to be hated. Try to be generous."]],[1804,["Now the generosity of maybe, I don’t know, but maybe of money,"]],[1812,["is not difficult for some people."]],[1815,["But generosity of saying something good to others is rare."]],[1822,["You see somebody in a good dress,"]],[1825,["you should be generous enough to say,"]],[1827,["“Oh, it’s fantastic, it’s beautiful.” What’s wrong?"]],[1832,["But jealousy, that goes against Lakshmi completely."]],[1838,["It’s better that others are wearing it;"]],[1841,["you don’t pay for it and you enjoy it! (laughter)"]],[1845,["It’s very logical you just see."]],[1849,["You see, if you own this hall, it will be a headache for you isn’t it,"]],[1854,["to keep it alright. I mean imagine the people who own it,"]],[1857,["and to put it right because everybody will come and criticise,"]],[1860,["“This is not good, that’s not good.”"]],[1862,["But it’s nice to be here, when it doesn’t belong to you, to enjoy it."]],[1867,["It’s very simple. Just try to enjoy it, to be generous with people,"]],[1872,["be kind to them. This generosity is lacking."]],[1878,["When this starts, then the inner core of emotional being starts"]],[1884,["getting enlightened."]],[1886,["Go to the subtler side of material well-being"]],[1891,["and you start getting into emotional thing."]],[1896,["Small, small things work out, very small."]],[1902,["It’s very sweet."]],[1905,["We have so many examples of this kind of little sweetness"]],[1912,["being expressed."]],[1916,["And this generosity should come to all the Sahaja Yogis,"]],[1922,["of saying good things to others."]],[1924,["Doesn’t matter [that] it is exaggeration, doesn’t matter,"]],[1930,["because it acts as a buffer."]],[1935,["Then the fright of the strangers,"]],[1938,["fright of the neighbours, fright of other human beings, you know."]],[1942,["Every human being has become now [that] he sees"]],[1944,["another human being coming, he recoils back. Imagine!"]],[1948,["First, I mean, say about fifty years back it was like dogs;"]],[1951,["if any human being saw another human being they used to bark!"]],[1955,["Now it is another way round. So, the fear of your brother,"]],[1961,["of your own kin and kith, of your part and parcel."]],[1967,["They are your own, you don’t know, they are part and parcel of your being,"]],[1971,["you can feel it, after Sahaja Yoga you can feel it,"]],[1974,["I don’t have to tell you."]],[1977,["You can feel them within yourself, they are within you."]],[1982,["And then the sweetness of saying something sweet,"]],[1989,["of saying something sweet, is so nice,"]],[1996,["is so rewarding, itself, itself, so rewarding."]],[2002,["The movement of Shakti is always this way."]],[2006,["If I give you love, love comes back to me."]],[2010,["If I give you hatred, hatred comes back to me."]],[2013,["And double fold everything. If I give you love,"]],[2018,["say 1 unit, I may get 7 units of love."]],[2022,["But if I give you hatred of 1, that too,"]],[2025,["7 units of hatred comes to you."]],[2028,["The mathematics is complete."]],[2032,["So try to understand that, emotionally,"]],[2037,["you have to understand your material well-being."]],[2041,["How to express emotionally your material well-being"]],[2046,["is a very sweet thing."]],[2050,["I would give you an example of Gavin"]],[2052,["because I can’t forget that very sweet incident:"]],[2057,["One day we had called some people, you see,"]],[2061,["I didn’t know there would be so many coming, in his house."]],[2064,["And he has a house but, I mean, not so big like this."]],[2068,["So there were about fifty people, around. And I told him,"]],[2071,["“Prepare some food for them.” But I thought for fifty people"]],[2075,["he could not have prepared, at the most for ten people!"]],[2078,["So I was quite embarrassed  and I was waiting for people to go away,"]],[2082,["I didn’t say, “Stay on for dinner,” or anything, I thought,"]],[2085,["“Poor Gavin, how could he have cooked for fifty people?”"]],[2089,["And when they disappeared, about five, six were remained."]],[2092,["I said, “Now let’s have dinner!” He was very unhappy"]],[2095,["and he was looking this side and that side,"]],[2098,["I said, “What happened?” But he didn’t say anything."]],[2100,["So I slept that night in his house. Next morning I got up –"]],[2103,["still he was very uneasy. Next day I said,"]],[2107,["“What’s the matter? What’s playing on your mind?”"]],[2110,["He said, “Mother why did you ask all of them to go away?"]],[2113,["I had prepared [dinner] for fifty of them?”"]],[2115,["This filled me with such joy you can’t imagine!"]],[2118,["Tremendous joy,"]],[2122,["tremendous joy."]],[2124,["I mean, that I cannot get over such things you know."]],[2127,["And I have just seen so many Sahaja Yogis like that,"]],[2130,["very very sweet persons. Another is Gregoire,"]],[2132,["another very sweetie person, you know, the way he does things for others."]],[2138,["Sometimes the way he works it out is so sweet,"]],[2143,["and how he really knows how to express himself sweetly"]],[2149,["in small, little things."]],[2153,["It’s so surprising, how people are very beautiful"]],[2159,["and how they are working out these material things"]],[2165,["to express their emotions."]],[2167,["Material is for emotions only, you see."]],[2171,["My mother had a principal that, if she had six sarees,"]],[2174,["the seventh one she’ll present out."]],[2176,["She had kept six; not more [are] needed, you see."]],[2180,["And she was a woman of great principle, I must say,"]],[2183,["because she used to spin her own sarees. Can you imagine!"]],[2188,["And that’s what she used to wear, herself."]],[2191,["And she was a wife of a very rich man, I mean,"]],[2193,["she had no problem of money but this was her principle,"]],[2196,["she used to live like that. And she said that,"]],[2198,["“What? I need six, more than [that] I don’t need,”"]],[2202,["because it’s cotton sarees, you see, so"]],[2204,["one saree you wash and next you wear and you can just press it."]],[2208,["We had people in the house who could do that for her."]],[2211,["She said, “There’s no need to have more than six.”"]],[2214,["And one she would keep for some occasion, you see, expensive one,"]],[2217,["if she has to go for a wedding and all that, that’s all."]],[2220,["So the seventh was kept (to give away) and out of the six,"]],[2223,["if she got one more she would donate that to somebody."]],[2226,["She would only keep up to six you see, that was her principle,"]],[2231,["and she managed her life very well."]],[2235,["And I was also bit too much of a generous person"]],[2242,["and she always supported my generosity, always she supported it."]],[2247,["And she was very happy when she found that I would just give away"]],[2251,["lots of things to people who came to my house and she would say,"]],[2254,["“Oh that’s very good, she should do that.”"]],[2256,["Everybody used to say that, “That should be done”."]],[2258,["Always used to encourage me for such things that I did."]],[2261,["But I found [that] all things have only value"]],[2263,["if I can give them away otherwise they have no value."]],[2267,["And I keep only the things that are being presented to me"]],[2270,["all the rest pass out of my hands very easily into people."]],[2273,["Anybody who says, “I like this,” “Alright, have it!”"]],[2276,["You see, I feel so happy to give it to them and it’s really rewarding."]],[2280,["Now that person thinks, “What should I give you back?”"]],[2282,["I said, “Now please! That’s not to be done"]],[2284,["because you know already, come and see, this house is filled"]],[2287,["with things, and I don’t know how to get rid of them.”"]],[2290,["If I buy anything myself, of course I don’t earn anything"]],[2294,["so it’s from my husband’s money, I try to give it away."]],[2300,["It’s very nice, it’s really extremely nice."]],[2303,["After all what’s the use of these things in the house?"]],[2306,["What are you going to do [with them]?"]],[2309,["I mean, if you have to have a personal archives, you can have!"]],[2312,["You see, something like that, putting up this thing bought there,"]],[2316,["this thing bought there. But normally what do you do?"]],[2320,["So this kind of a generosity is to be developed within us."]],[2325,["The aesthetics of generosity is to be seen."]],[2333,["How you give things to others and how you express your emotional being."]],[2339,["For people who are emotionally dry because of ego orientation,"]],[2344,["should learn these things, is very important."]],[2348,["That will give them some emotional side also."]],[2352,["[It’s] very much necessary for people"]],[2355,["who do not feel their feelings much, their joy much;"]],[2360,["they should try to do it [then] they will start feeling it much more."]],[2365,["Then the emotional side is enlightened within us,"]],[2371,["the Grace starts flowing up to emotional side."]],[2376,["In emotional side, first of all the purification takes place."]],[2380,["That’s very important."]],[2382,["To lead a very beautiful emotional life"]],[2385,["you must have pure ideas,"]],[2388,["otherwise you can never be emotionally alright."]],[2392,["You see, like in a tree you have to have leaves"]],[2395,["you have to have roots, you have to have fruits,"]],[2398,["you have to have flowers at it’s proper places."]],[2402,["Like in your house you have to have a drawing room,"]],[2405,["you have to have a bedroom, you have to have a bathroom;"]],[2409,["everything separated. You do not put them into a complete,"]],[2413,["what do you call that? A mixer."]],[2419,["You do not make it like that, isn’t it?"]],[2422,["You don’t put your bathroom in the drawing rooms do you?"]],[2425,["I mean some people may start it with the kind of confusion"]],[2428,["they have these days! But normally you do not do it."]],[2431,["In our own emotional life we must have pure sense."]],[2439,["Purity of a sisterly love, purity of a brotherly love,"]],[2445,["purity of a wife’s love."]],[2447,["For example infidelity: infidelity is impurity,"]],[2453,["infidelity comes when there is impurity."]],[2456,["Without fidelity the marriage life cannot be happy."]],[2460,["That’s the basis of married life."]],[2462,["You see, “I like…”  this “I like” business is impurity."]],[2468,["The impurity in you likes it."]],[2472,["Gradually, after realisation, you start developing"]],[2474,["that purity within you;"]],[2478,["you start understanding these are your brothers and sisters."]],[2484,["As soon as your emotional life starts improving"]],[2489,["your innocence starts awakening up."]],[2491,["You see? It is connected with your innocence."]],[2495,["The left side is connected with your innocence."]],[2499,["And then it starts flowering and you really become innocent."]],[2505,["Now see the practical side: you go to somebody’s house,"]],[2510,["the gentleman has a beautiful wife, now your bad eyes on the wife,"]],[2514,["how can you enjoy? You cannot enjoy, the husband cannot enjoy,"]],[2518,["the wife cannot enjoy, all the time there’s a fear."]],[2521,["Maybe the wife may run away with you or something may happen:"]],[2525,["the whole house will be finished, I mean, you are so destructive!"]],[2528,["So-called ‘charming’ men and ‘charming’ women"]],[2532,["are just destroying each others lives."]],[2534,["Where do they land? All in the orphanages!"]],[2538,["A woman marries seven times, a husband marries eight times."]],[2541,["All these old people are in the orphanage"]],[2544,["and children are in another orphanage."]],[2546,["You see, you are just creating orphanages by this kind of impurity"]],[2550,["in your mind. But by telling you, these things,"]],[2553,["you are not going to believe me, nor you can do it,"]],[2557,["but just when it happens."]],[2560,["When this happens, the innocence, the joy of pure love,"]],[2565,["when there is no other impurity but just pure love"]],[2571,["for brothers, sisters. I mean, here,"]],[2575,["I have seen people don’t even sort of embrace each other– men."]],[2580,["It’s most surprising,"]],[2582,["I mean, for us it’s something one can’t understand."]],[2586,["So much impurity has gone into our brain that every man,"]],[2589,["is he that way wrong?"]],[2590,["When we came here my husband used to embrace every man;"]],[2593,["I told him, “Don’t do it, people will laugh at you!”"]],[2595,["He said, “Really?”"]],[2597,["He said, “But everyone is not like that, maybe one person.”"]],[2599,["I said, “No, they think everybody is like that.”"]],[2602,["You see, whatever they found pathological in one person,"]],[2605,["they think everybody is like that."]],[2607,["These psychologists, whatever they read in one abnormal person,"]],[2613,["they try to see in everyone! Everybody is not like that!"]],[2616,["I mean there is no harm in understanding"]],[2620,["that there is only 1% people are pathological"]],[2624,["-who go to these psychologists!"]],[2627,["The others who are spoilt are because of psychologists themselves!"]],[2630,["They put ideas, “You have a guilt, you have a guilt, you have a guilt.”"]],[2634,["Even if you don’t have, you will have it! (laughter)"]],[2638,["They go on putting ideas into your heads."]],[2641,["All this is supposed to be intellectual expansion,"]],[2644,["whatever you may call it, it’s all nonsense you see."]],[2647,["A person who doesn’t commit sin you say,"]],[2649,["“Oh, he must have committed sin,”"]],[2650,["now he doesn’t know what to do he’ll come and say,"]],[2653,["“Alright baba, I have committed sin, now I have to confess."]],[2655,["So I have to confess, yes I have committed sin.”"]],[2657,["They play about like this."]],[2659,["They just try to build you up and all that"]],[2661,["and then they break you, shatter you completely and then you think,"]],[2664,["“Oh I am the most sinful person [who] ever lived!”"]],[2670,["If you were that sinful,"]],[2672,["do you think you will get realisation first of all?"]],[2678,["First ask yourself the question, “How did I get realisation?"]],[2683,["How did I feel vibrations?"]],[2684,["If I was that sinful, how could I get it?”"]],[2688,["Throw away all these ideas of these psychologists"]],[2691,["and tell them that we don’t believe you!"]],[2693,["You see, this is very few people who are really basically sinful."]],[2697,["I tell you, very, very rarely, I have not seen anyone so far,"]],[2703,["except for these horrible gurus who are well known!"]],[2705,["After all they are the people who are rakshasas,"]],[2709,["they are not human beings, you see, so that’s a different category."]],[2712,["But, otherwise, I have not seen basically a person"]],[2715,["who has nothing good in him. Because everybody has the Spirit."]],[2721,["And definitely Spirit is superior much more dynamic"]],[2725,["than all the sins put together."]],[2726,["What are these little, little sins here and there? What are you doing?"]],[2730,["And there’s nothing to feel so diffident about it."]],[2733,["After all you are realised people, you are saints."]],[2737,["You are to be respected."]],[2740,["You have to respect yourself first of all."]],[2744,["You are all saints, do you realise that?"]],[2748,["Once you realise you are saints you will start acting as saints,"]],[2752,["how the saints act."]],[2754,["You will put yourself onto that pedestal of understanding"]],[2757,["that you are really saints, otherwise you won’t get vibrations."]],[2760,["Go and ask anyone of these!"]],[2762,["They will tell you: the vibrations, only people who are saints get it."]],[2766,["In India all the people are burnt when they die;"]],[2771,["not the saints, realised souls are not,"]],[2777,["they are respected."]],[2780,["They say when the saints come to your house,"]],[2782,["that’s the day, is the day of festival."]],[2787,["And all of you are that so don’t think that you cannot do this,"]],[2794,["and you have this guilt and you have these things –"]],[2797,["nothing of the kind! You are pure Spirit."]],[2802,["Be very lavish about it!"]],[2806,["Of course, I mean, too much indulgences into these things,"]],[2813,["emotional life also, can lead you to a stagnation point."]],[2818,["Like I hear people saying that, “There’s a lot of love between us.”"]],[2825,["But one has to be discreet in that also:"]],[2829,["does it make you universal or it makes you localised?"]],[2835,["You see, like Britishers for British, Indians for Indians, finished!"]],[2841,["If that love makes you universal, by which you say kindly things,"]],[2850,["by which you enjoy the love of other people, their vibrations."]],[2857,["Whatever creed, race, it is, whatever part of the world they come from,"]],[2862,["they are Sahaja Yogis; if you start enjoying them,"]],[2865,["then know that that is love."]],[2870,["It should not be localised in any way."]],[2873,["If there is any group forming, then must know that it is not love,"]],[2879,["it’s not Divinity, it’s not."]],[2884,["Divinity is universal, it embraces everything, everything."]],[2890,["It has no discrimination of any kind."]],[2894,["It only discriminates between evil and good,"]],[2900,["unrighteous and righteous,"]],[2904,["Christ and anti-Christ,"]],[2907,["God and anti-God"]],[2912,["but it does not discriminate on these three levels"]],[2916,["that is physical appearances, mental approach"]],[2923,["or mental development or emotional expressions."]],[2928,["Some people are emotionally very expressive."]],[2930,["I would say English are less expressive by temperament maybe,"]],[2935,["that’s their temperament. Indians are extremely expressive."]],[2938,["If you go to India, to a village, say,"]],[2940,["you go to Rahuri (Maharashtra), they will just take you"]],[2944,["in their embrace and would start weeping and crying with joy."]],[2949,["I mean, you will be amazed the way they will love you, I mean, imagine!"]],[2953,["And for them it would be like, they wouldn’t mind"]],[2958,["even if they have to spread themselves on the ground"]],[2962,["for you to walk smoothly"]],[2965,["so that you don’t feel the horrible roads of India."]],[2971,["That kind of tremendous emotions,"]],[2973,["the expression you will be surprised."]],[2976,["You will be overwhelmed and sometimes shocked,"]],[2978,["you know, the way they are."]],[2982,["But that doesn’t mean that English don’t love."]],[2985,["They love in their own way; they understand that."]],[2991,["So that’s how it should be that it is all embracing,"]],[2995,["all shades, all types, all permutations, combinations."]],[2999,["Because this variety is created by God to create beauty"]],[3003,["and all the varieties must be accepted."]],[3005,["Imagine you all looking just the same,"]],[3008,["how would it look? Horrible and boring!"]],[3012,["Every leaf is different, then what about human beings?"]],[3016,["But in that difference there’s the unity of Spirit"]],[3019,["and if you can feel that unity"]],[3022,["then you are emotionally absolutely correct and you are a realised soul."]],[3029,["And, last of all, the most important, is your Spirit,"]],[3035,["Spirit that resides in your heart."]],[3039,["All this beauty is only perceived when there is light in your Spirit"]],[3045,["otherwise you cannot see all this beauty, you cannot enjoy it."]],[3050,["Spirit is the one which is the diamond"]],[3059,["which shines on this beautiful ring of your body,"]],[3063,["mind and your emotions. That’s the most important thing."]],[3069,["That is to be achieved, to be absolutely absorbed into your being."]],[3077,["That state should be achieved by all of you."]],[3081,["But the growth, if the outside is not alright,"]],[3086,["then the inside cannot be carried by that weak outside."]],[3094,["It’s such a strong thing spiritual life is a very strong thing;"]],[3099,["it’s so dynamic, it’s so powerful."]],[3104,["Sometimes, you know, it floods me completely."]],[3108,["I mean, I have to control myself;"]],[3111,["the love just shoots off from the being"]],[3114,["and just I want to give it but I wonder"]],[3121,["whether you’ll be able to bear it,"]],[3127,["so I have to control it a little bit [because]"]],[3129,["that flood may not be borne."]],[3132,["So you have to enrich your outside to bear that inside beauty."]],[3138,["And the more you enrich it, the more you make it strong,"]],[3142,["the more it will shine."]],[3145,["It’s so simultaneous because one must understand that Spirit is love,"]],[3154,["is all intelligence, is all awareness,"]],[3159,["and it knows your problem. It slowly shines."]],[3162,["It sees how far you can bear, how far you can go."]],[3168,["Then after realisation, when you start looking after your outside,"]],[3175,["the inside starts shining by itself."]],[3180,["But attention should be towards your Spirit."]],[3185,["All these outside qualities are so joy-giving to the Spirit."]],[3190,["You can’t imagine. Try them!"]],[3194,["You will enjoy yourself."]],[3196,["We have not been able to enjoy ourselves much."]],[3198,["If we could we would not [even] shun the jails,"]],[3201,["I mean I would be happy in a jail I tell you,"]],[3204,["because I can enjoy myself there better!"]],[3207,["But the one thing is there, you cannot enjoy yourself"]],[3210,["so much when you cannot share it with others also isn’t it?"]],[3214,["It becomes like that. Without sharing you cannot enjoy yourself."]],[3220,["And that’s what should happen to all the Sahaja Yogis."]],[3223,["At that level you should come. We should be at that level."]],[3228,["Try to keep your level that high, is important."]],[3232,["Sometimes you come down, you start criticising others."]],[3237,["Others are also not right, for example, somebody sees"]],[3239,["somebody filthy, dirty, something like that."]],[3242,["The person who’s filthy, dirty, of course"]],[3244,["there’s something wrong with that person, no doubt,"]],[3247,["but that person should be pitied. At least he should be clean."]],[3250,["I mean, that’s the minimum of minimum."]],[3254,["But instead of that if you start criticising that person,"]],[3257,["you also become filthy in your language,"]],[3259,["filthy in your mind and everything, so why [do it]? Leave it!"]],[3262,["Let that person improve by himself,"]],[3264,["to see that he has to be clean, he has to be neat,"]],[3266,["he has to be sensible."]],[3270,["This is to be seen by that person himself and not by you."]],[3273,["Where is your attention?"]],[3277,["It’s a habit in India, all the parents will ask the children"]],[3280,["when they are standing, “Where is your attention?”"]],[3283,["“Where is my attention?” alright. Then again he’s standing there,"]],[3286,["“Where is your attention?” Again he’ll be on the watch [out],"]],[3289,["“Where is my attention gone?”"]],[3291,["We have to look after our attention, that’s all."]],[3294,["“Where is my attention? Is it on the Spirit?”"]],[3299,["Next time I’ll tell you more about the Spirit part."]],[3303,["I hope you have understood how necessary it is"]],[3306,["to develop your inner being."]],[3310,["In your mental being, egoistical nature is to be controlled very much."]],[3316,["I have seen people who go from left to right, they become egoistical."]],[3322,["Those who go from right to left, they become frightened."]],[3327,["All these side movements must be brought to the centre."]],[3336,["You have to understand that from basics we have to rise higher."]],[3341,["People have explanation for everything! No explanation is needed."]],[3346,["Whom are you explaining? You are explaining to yourself,"]],[3349,["you are judging yourself. You have to judge yourself,"]],[3353,["[to] whom are you explaining? Mataji?"]],[3356,["She doesn’t need any explanation."]],[3359,["I know, perhaps, everything, perhaps."]],[3364,["But I don’t condemn you and in any way"]],[3366,["I do not want that you should be condemned by any chance at all,"]],[3369,["why should I? You are all saints after all."]],[3371,["For me it’s the greatest satisfaction."]],[3375,["But for your own growth I want you to understand"]],[3381,["that you are saints and you have to come up to that point."]],[3384,["Saints have to be self-disciplined, nobody has to tell them."]],[3387,["Discipline yourself,"]],[3391,["tell yourself, “I am a saint now.”"]],[3394,["What an opportunity it is to grow! What an opportunity!"]],[3400,["And people are only going to believe in you"]],[3402,["when you are really the saint within and saint without."]],[3409,["In Sahaja Yoga, people become saints within"]],[3412,["and not saints without easily."]],[3414,["But in other systems they are first made outside, you see,"]],[3417,["they are made to work for 25 years just washing the temple – finished!"]],[3423,["Then they are made to do something else for 25 years."]],[3426,["By the time they are about to [be] dead they’ll say,"]],[3428,["“Alright, next time we’ll give you realisation.”"]],[3432,["It’s like that. But here, from inside you have really achieved"]],[3439,["your realisation no doubt, and you have greater chances of improving."]],[3444,["This is what I thought, that,"]],[3446,["“This lifetime I am just going to give realisation"]],[3450,["to all the people who come to me – let’s see.”"]],[3453,["And you are going to do full justice to my bold step"]],[3461,["because now you’ve got it. It is going to work out much faster."]],[3466,["It has to work out."]],[3468,["This was the only way it could have worked out faster than to make you,"]],[3472,["first of all, wash yourself every day, get up at 4 o’clock and make you"]],[3478,["like military people . I said, “No, let’s try this way.”"]],[3486,["And it’s done, it’s happening, it’s so simple."]],[3491,["Then the self-discipline must start."]],[3495,["And you must try to improve your light,"]],[3497,["which is just kindled,"]],[3499,["to make it a beautiful light, clean light and generous,"]],[3505,["giving light, the light of love."]],[3510,["It will work out I am sure."]],[3512,["Keep your standards high. Do not fall down."]],[3518,["Put your attention into proper gear."]],[3521,["It’s all prophesised, as you know. Blake has prophesised it."]],[3526,["The more I read the book the more I am convinced"]],[3530,["that England is going to be the Jerusalem."]],[3533,["Now think of that. No lethargy allowed."]],[3539,["While I find Australians are coming up much faster."]],[3545,["You have to prove Blake’s prophesy."]],[3549,["May God bless you. All of you."]],[3555,["Cooly, can you give me some water please?"]],[3561,["Look at the children!!"]],[3563,["All quiet! Thank you very much."]],[3575,["If you could arrange a seminar Gavin, anytime,"]],[3581,["for three days, I can postpone my going to India."]],[3586,["As I would like to have a seminar sometime."]],[3588,["Gavin: We can get a place in Sussex, from the,"]],[3593,["I think it’s the twelfth, no the eleventh, to the thirteenth,"]],[3597,["that’s a mid-week time. We can have about 45-50 people."]],[3603,["Shri Mataji: We have many more."]],[3607,["I would like to have it on a Saturday Sunday somewhere."]],[3610,["Gavin: We can find somewhere"]],[3612,["but it is difficult to get these places for a weekend."]],[3615,["We’re still trying."]],[3617,["Shri Mataji: I think in a, any place, like Brighton or something"]],[3623,["you might get it, or why not hire a boat?"]],[3637,["Isn’t it a good idea?"]],[3639,["Gavin: We can see what we can do."]],[3644,["Actually I was looking out for a ship."]],[3646,["If one of the Shipping Corporation ships had arrived,"]],[3649,["I thought we’ll go and stay in a ship, would be a good idea,"]],[3652,["because it always is there for about three four days."]],[3655,["But there’s no ship arriving in this month"]],[3659,["otherwise, we could have done it."]],[3663,["Some sort of a boat for two days you can hire,"]],[3665,["a big boat where all of us could be there on a Saturday Sunday."]],[3669,["We should be there, it’s important."]],[3671,["Before I leave I would like to fix some certain screws."]],[3679,["I mean, you can have it on Thames River if you want."]],[3683,["Or Brighton, do you have boats or things? No? Just find out."]],[3691,["So that should be resolved"]],[3692,["and then I will arrange my going accordingly."]],[3695,["If there is any program like that I will postpone it."]],[3698,["But I would like to know as soon as possible."]],[3710,["As I have told you before that Sahaja Yoga has no technique;"]],[3714,["it’s a spontaneous happening which takes place."]],[3720,["Now the flower becomes the fruit, it has no technique,"]],[3728,["but the sun has to come to do the job, you see,"]],[3732,["and that technique is beyond our understanding."]],[3736,["In the same way it happens – just transformation."]],[3743,["But later on you must know how to maintain"]],[3746,["and how to keep it up, that’s all."]],[3748,["Once it is managed it can be worked out."]],[3751,["Many people have done it, and you should be able to do it also."]],[3757,["But try not to see others. See yourself first."]],[3761,["That’s very important. That is a very important part."]],[3765,["CLERCK"]],[3766,["If you can put your hands towards me, like this just,"]],[3771,["and close your eyes, just close your eyes."]],[3784,["If your hands are shaking or your body is shaking"]],[3788,["or your eyes are fluttering, I mean the eyelids,"]],[3792,["then you open your eyes and just watch me,"]],[3797,["just watch me on my forehead."]],[3803,["Have you been to some guru or someone? No one?"]],[3808,["What do you do for your work?"]],[3813,["Seeker: I’m a clerk."]],[3814,["Shri Mataji: Ah, that’s it."]],[3817,["Ah, the right side is too much used."]],[3823,["Should work out. Are"]],[3829,["you shaking also?"]],[3832,["No? You are getting cool breeze? It’s great."]],[3836,["Are you getting? Not yet. None of the fingers? Which one?"]],[3844,["Did you go to any guru or anyone? Did you to anyone? Guru or anyone?"]],[3849,["To spiritualist or anyone? No?"]],[3860,["Are you getting cool breeze? Good."]],[3867,["Put both the feet straight. Relax. You are getting? Good."]],[3873,["Close your eyes and enjoy your Self."]],[3880,["Better now. Just do it like that, you see."]],[3883,["It’s more on the right side, is a problem."]],[3886,["It’s because too much thinking, thinking, you know."]],[3889,["So the imbalance of…too much thinking also gives an imbalance, you see."]],[3895,["All the time you’re thinking, thinking, thinking."]],[3898,["That gives you a trouble. It should work out."]],[3902,["See, put your left hand on the stomach, the centre, yes."]],[3907,["Put your right hand now towards me, like this."]],[3911,["Now the shaking will be less."]],[3917,["Put it there so you will be comfortable."]],[3920,["It will reduce gradually."]],[3923,["1’05’30"]],[3923,["You See? This is nothing but there’s nervousness inside,"]],[3928,["which has to go out."]],[3930,["You see the nerves have been too much tortured by thinking."]],[3938,["Now it’s better, soothing down."]],[3943,["Much better, see?"]],[3944,["It will soothe down."]],[3946,["END CLERCK"]],[3947,["Anne, there are some new people I see on the left hand side."]],[3951,["Just see them, if they are realised, all of them."]],[3953,["Just see some of these people who are there."]],[3960,["Yah, just see. Have you got cool breeze there?"]],[3966,["Have you got cool breeze in the hand?"]],[3971,["What did you say? You have got it?"]],[3976,["Seeker: YesShri Mataji: Good. Good."]],[3978,["They are from Brighton are they?"]],[3980,["Have you come from Brighton? No. Good."]],[3984,["Jason, just see if they are getting cool breeze on the head also."]],[3991,["This side, are there new people?"]],[3997,["You got the cool breeze?"]],[3999,["Seeker: Not sure"]],[4000,["Shri Mataji: All right, it comes so much that you’ll get sure of it,"]],[4004,["all right? Just work it out."]],[4012,["You can work out."]],[4018,["There also."]],[4020,["Peter, in front of you there, just see, someone."]],[4027,["Behind is there someone sitting?"]],[4029,["He’s come for the first time?"]],[4035,["How are you, Anna? Better?"]],[4042,["She’s got it."]],[4048,["Better now? It’s better."]],[4051,["Still there? Less, but much less."]],[4055,["Just do it like that.","Just throw it away. Throw it away."]],[4059,["It has to go out. Now, let’s see."]],[4066,["Just imagine."]],[4068,["Throw it away again, it’s horrible."]],[4074,["Who’s there?","Left to the right, you just put him,"]],[4076,["left to the right for him. Come along. Good."]],[4079,["Put it left to the right yes.","They will do it. You put your right hand, yes."]],[4087,["Are you better now? Are you feeling any cool breeze?"]],[4100,["How many years you have worked as a clerk?"]],[4102,["Clerk: Twelve."]],[4110,["Shri Mataji: Look after his Vishuddhi","and centre heart. He’ll be all right."]],[4115,["Yah! Vishuddhi and centre heart."]],[4122,["Terrific, they are terrific people."]],[4129,["All right, is she all right?"]],[4132,["What? Put your left hand here."]],[4136,["All right? A little bit and put both the feet straight"]],[4139,["like that on the ground would be better. Like this,"]],[4144,["both the feet. Yes, let’s see."]],[4146,["She’s all right, I think, she’s got it."]],[4152,["She’s all right. What about this gentleman? Left to the right."]],[4160,["It’s nice you came to see me."]],[4164,["Really, because anything could have happened, you know,"]],[4168,["with this kind of a tremendous pressure on your mind."]],[4173,["It’s still there. It will be."]],[4179,["That’s how people get all these troubles, like diabetes, you see."]],[4183,["Then even if they don’t listen to that then they could get heart."]],[4187,["Then you get other problems on the left hand side, you see."]],[4191,["Even paralysis can be due to this."]],[4193,["It’s a very bad thing to work like that, worrying about it."]],[4198,["Are you all right?"]],[4203,["It will work out. What is it, John?"]],[4205,["John Watkinson: Nabhi."]],[4206,["Shri Mataji: Nabhi? Nabhi."]],[4209,["Put your left hand on the stomach. Stomach, yes."]],[4214,["What about him?"]],[4216,["Yogini: Left Nabhi"]],[4218,["Shri Mataji: Are you married?Seeker: I’m not"]],[4221,["You are not married?Seeker: No."]],[4223,["Shri Mataji: You don’t want to marry?Seeker: I’m a widower."]],[4229,["Shri Mataji: When was that?"]],[4230,["Seeker: About eight years ago."]]]);
